[al:新概念英语第二册]
[ti:86. Out of Control]
[00:00.670]Passage 86|文章八十六
[00:02.770]Out of control.|失控
[00:05.550]As the man tried to swing the speedboat round,|当那人试图开着快艇转弯时，
[00:09.670]the steering wheel came away in his hands.|方向盘脱了手。
[00:13.130]He waved desperately to his companion,|他绝望地向他的同伴挥手，
[00:16.530]who had been water skiing for the last 15 minutes.|后者已经滑水15分钟了。
[00:20.230]Both men had hardly had time to realize what was happening,|两个人还没来得及明白发生了什么事情，
[00:24.050]when they were thrown violently into the sea.|就被猛地抛进了海里。
[00:28.290]The speedboat had struck a buoy,|快艇撞上了一个浮标，
[00:31.130]but it continued to move very quickly across the water.|但它仍继续飞快地在水面前进。
[00:36.150]Both men had just begun to swim towards the shore,|两人刚开始向岸边游去，
[00:39.290]when they noticed with dismay that the speedboat was moving in a circle.|就惊恐地发现快艇正在转圈。
[00:45.270]It now came straight towards them at a tremendous speed.|它现在正以惊人的速度向他们冲来。
[00:49.870]In less than a minute, it roared past them only a few feet away.|不到一分钟，它就从离他们几英尺远的地方轰鸣而过。
[00:55.430]After it had passed, they swam on as quickly as they could,|快艇开过去之后，他们便尽快地往前游，
[00:59.410]because they knew that the boat would soon return.|因为他们知道那艘快艇很快会转回来。
[01:03.390]They had just had enough time to swim out of danger,|他们刚来得及游出险境，
[01:06.730]when the boat again completed a circle.|快艇又转了一个圈。
[01:11.090]On this occasion, however, it had slowed down considerably.|然而，这一次快艇的速度大大减慢了。
[01:15.930]The petrol had nearly all been used up.|汽油差不多已经用完了。
[01:19.310]Before long, the noise dropped completely,|没过多久，轰鸣声完全消失了，
[01:22.630]and the boat began to drift gently across the water.|快艇开始在水面缓缓地漂流。